#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "planets"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "All eight planets that station, and what each is doing today."
msgstr ""
"Les huit planètes qui stationnent, et ce que chacune fait aujourd'hui."

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Rising Sign (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Signe ascendant (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "rising"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "ascendant"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The rising sign with its chart ruler. Needs coordinates: the ascendant is "
"the horizon at a place."
msgstr ""
"Le signe ascendant et sa planète maîtresse. Coordonnées requises : "
"l'ascendant correspond à l'horizon d'un lieu donné."

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Solar Return (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Révolution solaire (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "solar return"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "birthday"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "year ahead"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The chart of the moment the Sun returns to its birth position in a given "
"year, drawn into the page. Without a birth date it asks the visitor. Needs a"
" site key or an API key."
msgstr ""
"Le thème du moment où le Soleil revient à sa position natale au cours d’une "
"année donnée, dessiné dans la page. Sans date de naissance, il la demande au"
" visiteur. Nécessite une clé de site ou une clé API."

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Synastry Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Carte Natale (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "synastry"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/synastry/block.json blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "love"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Compatibility score and the cross-aspects behind it for two birth charts, "
"rendered into the page by api.astroway.info. No key needed."
msgstr ""
"Score de compatibilité et aspects croisés qui le sous-tendent pour deux "
"thèmes astral, affichés sur cette page via l'API api.astroway.info. Aucune "
"légende n'est nécessaire."

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tarot Spread of the Day (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Tirage de tarot du jour (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "spread"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "celtic cross"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Three cards or the Celtic Cross, drawn once a day for this site, each card "
"read in its position. A visitor can draw again."
msgstr ""
"Trois cartes ou la croix celtique, tirées une fois par jour pour ce site, "
"chaque carte lue à sa position. Le visiteur peut tirer à nouveau."

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Moon Transit Timeline (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Calendrier des transits lunaires (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "transit"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "week"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The next seven days of Moon ingresses, served by api.astroway.info as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Les sept prochains jours d'entrée de la Lune, fournis par api.astroway.info "
"sous forme d'iframe adaptative."

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Transit Sky (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Carte Natale (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "sky"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the transiting planets' signs and degrees for a date, served by "
"api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Roue de carte natale servie par api.astroway.info sous forme d'iframe "
"responsive."

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Week (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Horoscope de la semaine (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "weekly"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current week, anchored to Monday, rendered into the page "
"as text."
msgstr ""
"Horoscope de la semaine en cours, à compter de lundi, affiché sur la page "
"sous forme de texte."

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Year (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Horoscope de l'année (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "yearly"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "The year ahead for one zodiac sign."
msgstr "L'année à venir pour un signe du zodiaque."

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Zodiac Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Compatibilité des signes du zodiaque (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "How two zodiac signs read together."
msgstr "Comment s'accordent deux signes du zodiaque ?"

